{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003800","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003800"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003800","label":"病疽卒母（孫吳列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"卒母","mention_ids":["c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0048"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0048","chapter_id":"c-shiji-065-sun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:p009","quote":"卒母"}]},{"id":"cbr-p003806","label":"病疽卒（孫吳列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"病疽者","mention_ids":["c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0039"]},{"surface":"其子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0109"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-065-sun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:p009","quote":"病疽者"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0109","chapter_id":"c-shiji-065-sun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:p009","quote":"其子"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-065-sun:m009-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"卒母","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003800","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-065-sun"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji065-007","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003806","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"cbr-p003800","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-065-sun","source_id":"s-shiji-065-sun","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-065-sun:p009","quote":"起之為將，與士卒最下者同衣食。臥不設席，行不騎乘，親裹贏糧，與士卒分勞苦。卒有病疽者，起為吮之。卒母聞而哭之。人曰：「子卒也，而將軍自吮其疽，何哭為？」母曰：「非然也。往年吳公吮其父，其父戰不旋踵，遂死於敵。吳公今又吮其子，妾不知其死所矣。是以哭之。」"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"卒母","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示取妻、母、其子及故事局部父稱保存。孫武後世子孫只記祖先，不補直接父子；病卒家屬不接吳起親屬，公叔公主不接試延吳起公主。引語與來源故事保留範圍，不作獨立史實確證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji065-028","person_id":"cbr-p003800","surfa